ask(c,'Which pair of conditions is equivalent to −1≤cosθ2≤1 for positive link lengths?', ['|L1−L2|≤√(x²+y²)≤L1+L2','Only√(x²+y²)≤L1+L2','Only√(x²+y²)≥|L1−L2|','Every x,y pair is allowed when a third wrist joint exists'], ['Both lower and upper triangle inequalities follow by rearranging the cosine bounds.','This misses the inner unreachable region for unequal links.','This misses targets beyond maximum extension.','The third angle controls orientation but does not enlarge the shown wrist-position workspace.'],pages=[275,283,287],assumptions=PLANAR)
